#: ../../solid/crystal_properties.rst:2
msgid "結晶構造と物性"
msgstr "Crystal Structure and Physical Properties"

#: ../../solid/crystal_properties.rst:4
msgid ""
"結晶構造と物性の関係を、チタン酸バリウムの強誘電性と、1次元鎖の\\ :ref:`Peierls不安定性<peierls-"
"instability>`\\ を例に学びます。強誘電性は、相と分域の構造、\\ :ref:`周期結晶の分極<periodic-"
"polarization>`\\ の求め方、不安定性の起源の3つの記事に分けています。"
msgstr ""
"We use ferroelectricity in barium titanate and the \\ :ref:`Peierls "
"instability <peierls-instability>` \\ of a one-dimensional chain to learn"
" how crystal structure relates to physical properties. Three articles on "
"ferroelectricity cover the structures of phases and domains, how to "
"calculate the \\ :ref:`polarization of periodic crystals <periodic-"
"polarization>`\\ , and the origin of the instability."

